<title>NETHERLANDS: VASTNED OFFICES FIRST-HALF NET UP 15 PCT.</title>
<headline>VASTNED OFFICES FIRST-HALF NET UP 15 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Direct inv result (net profit)  14.2  vs  12.3</p>
<p>    Ditto per share (guilders)	 2.34 vs   2.31</p>
<p>    Net asset value/shr (guilders)  57.64 vs  58.13</p>
<p>    Net rental income		   17.8  vs  17.2</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     2.6  vs   4.1</p>
<p>    General costs			  1.0  vs   0.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Property fund VastNed Offices/Industrial NV said in</p>
<p>April it expected 1996 full-year earnings per share to be higher</p>
<p>than 1995's 4.67 guilders.</p>
</text>
